      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Running header in the outer margin: Table of Domain Institutions, Fascicle 9 (Shinjō, Shigehara). Fascicle 9 is the officials-and-military register. Provenance only — it names the two domains whose entries open on this leaf, and it says nothing about Shimabara, whose roster fills the lower right of the leaf."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "柱藩制一覽表第九（新莊、重原）"
