        "value": "[Shimabara] Junior councillor (shō-sanji). The heading stands low on the leaf, level with the roster registers rather than at the top, because this is the tail of an entry that began two half-leaves back: its last marker is ○嶋原藩 on lower_p238_left, so everything here to the right of the ○新莊藩 marker is still Shimabara's. No person-count is printed beside the heading; the combined figure 大少參事　八人 stands on the earlier leaf."
